OL,3,GNEWSANew security lanes to speed up
OL,4,Aairport checks
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew technology means passengers using
OL,7,FLeeds Bradford Airport (LBA) will have
OL,8,Fshorter waits for security checks,
OL,9,Fairport bosses have said.
OL,11,FA new Central Search Zone is opening,
OL,12,Fwith extra-long security lanes allowing
OL,13,Falmost double the number of people to
OL,14,Fbe screened per hour.
OL,16,FPassengers are also now able to leave
OL,17,Felectronics and liquids under 100ml in
OL,18,Ftheir bags, rather than having to take
OL,19,Fthem out to be scanned separately.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
