OL,3,GNEWSANew security lanes to speed up
OL,4,Aairport checks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe airport's management says it forms
OL,7,Fpart of their long-term vision to
OL,8,Fmodernise its infrastructure, improve
OL,9,Foperational efficiency and deliver an
OL,10,Fairport experience that meets the
OL,11,Fexpectations of a growing region.
